#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:312
msgid "Welcome to the getting started guide."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:324
msgid "Getting started with Intercessor is easy! We put together this quick start guide to help first time users of the plugin. Our goal is to get you up and running in no time. Let's begin!"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:329
msgid "STEP 1: Create a New Form"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:331
msgid "Intercessor is driven by it's powerful donation form building features. However, it is much more than just a \"donation form\". From the \"Add Form\" page you'll be able to choose how and where you want to receive your donations. You will also be able to set the preferred donation amounts."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:333
msgid "All of these features begin by simply going to the menu and choosing \"Donations > Add Form\"."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:350
msgid "STEP 2: Customize Your Donation Forms"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:352
msgid "Each donation form you create can be customized to receive either a pre-determined set donation amount or have multiple suggested levels of giving. Choosing \"Multi-level Donation\" opens up the donation levels view where you can add as many levels as you'd like with your own custom names and suggested amounts. As well, you can allow donors to give a custom amount and even set up donation goals."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:361
msgid "STEP 3: Add Additional Content"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:363
msgid "Every donation form you create with Intercessor can be used on its own stand-alone page, or it can be inserted into any other page or post throughout your site via a shortcode or widget."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:365
msgid "You can choose these different modes by going to the \"Form Content\" section. From there, you can choose to add content before or after the donation form on a page, or if you choose \"None\" perhaps you want to instead use the shortcode. You can find the shortcode in the top right column directly under the Publish/Save button. This feature gives you the most amount of flexibility with controlling your content on your website all within the same page."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:382
msgid "STEP 4: Configure Your Display Options"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Welcome.php:384
msgid "Lastly, you can present the form in a number of different ways that each create their own unique donor experience. The \"Modal\" display mode opens the credit card fieldset within a popup window. The \"Reveal\" mode will slide into place the additional fields. If you're looking for a simple button, then \"Button\" more is the way to go. This allows you to create a customizable \"Donate Now\" button which will open the donation form upon clicking. There's tons of possibilities here, give it a try!"
msgstr ""

